# held/props/harp: the small frame harp for the Lute posture's Harp variant (PROPS, P2b): a carved wooden frame with linen
# strings, held against the chest, the right hand plucking (hold, reach). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the right
# shoulder, under the hands.
